{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Roanoke S3","Roanoke Season 3","roanoke-s3"],"channel":{"category":"🏡 Player made buildings, Roanoke","id":"740291949843447869","name":"leafs-lookout","position":80,"server_id":"636012145204527125","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/roanoke-season-3/roanoke-season-3.sqlite","database_sha256":"16d47fa7c4f38d18670fc7fc2639614b0b61c31f716d8e6ecba86f1f87412b4d","project_ids":["roanoke-s3"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-01T23:13:18Z","id":"636012145204527125","name":"Roanoke Season 3"},"server_slug":"roanoke-season-3"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Web sighs. \"I didn't grow up with the most noble moral code. I don't think there was much wrong with what I believed, but when you grow up so apart from 'normal' society, things don't exactly mesh well. You know what I'm talking about. I had no knowledge of the Golden Dawn's reputation before I joined them. I didn't talk to the kind of people who would speak openly about them. By the time I understood, I was in too deep. This damnation, the petrification, is the punishment I bear.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:21:14.469000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741224426112155670","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Baeshra's head stays by Web as she listens, her tail slowly curls around Leaf.","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:23:07.575000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741224900513103953","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"Oh... Ok.\" Leaf takes in Web's words. \"I actually don't know a lot about the Golden Dawn, besides what Daysong told me about Solomon and that they're bad. What exactly do they do?\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:26:18.538000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-07T09:29:19.106000Z","id":"741225701470109746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Web stops and thinks. \"I... I know that we said no more secrets, but.\" Web trails off, then stops suddenly. \"No, I said I would do this. I-\" Web stops again","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:28:11.046000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741226173362602065","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Baeshra's head perks slightly watching Web, less curious and more concerned.","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:29:18.767000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741226457405194280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"I... I don't want to force you to say anything. That's not how I want this to go. If it was, I would have done it on the sub.\" She points the the holy symbol around her neck and shakes her head. \"If it'll get people hurt then you don't have to tell me.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:31:50.871000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741227095375478806","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"Not people. Just me.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:37:59.706000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741228642381594624","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf flinches. In a flash a scene plays in her mind. Of her using Zone of Truth on Web, and how poorly it would have gone. Ashamed she ever considered it.  Leaf looks from Baeshra then back to Web. She shakes her head. \"You're more important than answers. I know you're not with them, that's the important part.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:43:45.829000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741230094126678016","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Web nods. \"Can't help but feel guilty. Caused lot of hurt. Part of Web feels deserve it.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:46:11.647000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741230705731960882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"Want to say. Want to say so badly. But... scared. Scared of petrification, maybe new damnation.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:48:29.341000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741231283262455859","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf thinks for a moment. \"Well... I guess you would know better than me, but when I tried Commanding Goanhawe to confess, I pictured the breaking of a dam. All that pressure finally releasing. I was hoping it would make things better. Would saying these things make you feel better despite the risk?\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:52:34.613000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741232312007786527","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"I... I wish I could have told you earlier. But I didn't remember everything until last week. My memory was altered.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T09:59:10.085000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741233970737446993","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"To be honest, you may be right about saying these things.\" Web takes a deep breath.","created_at":"2020-08-07T10:00:48.815000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741234384841211905","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"I don't know their ultimate goals. I know that the attack on the sub by the summoner was a distraction to sneak something on board. I know they sought to get the contract signed. I know they-\" Web's breath seems to catch for a moment.","created_at":"2020-08-07T10:01:36.854000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741234586331250709","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"They pause as fear overtakes their face.","created_at":"2020-08-07T10:01:51.489000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741234647714758736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"They try to speak again, and are able. But they are clearly shaken \"They sought after an item retrieved from the sunken temple. I can only imagine that they seek to Weaken both the knights and the masons, and by doing so claim greater power.\" Web stops, breathing heavily.","created_at":"2020-08-07T10:03:29.480000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741235058718933032","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"I think... I think that's all I know.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T10:03:56.987000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741235174091522119","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
