{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf lets out a sigh of relief upon hearing something hopefully unrelated to Mello. \"Ok... But you left them, and now they're doing this to you? Are there other people here who are still with them then?\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T10:10:59.810000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741236947539984414","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Web shrugs. \"They rebuild fast, from what I've gathered. Those who joined with me are either dead or ex-members. But there could already be others.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T10:13:50.977000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741237665466155038","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"Even if they have not found new members, s- his reach is extraordinarily long. He did this\" Web gestures to their patches of stone. \"They may not need new members as anything more than scapegoats.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T10:15:13.489000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741238011546697818","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf's eyes go distant for a moment. \"So then Ebuc...?\" She doesn't know how to finish the question.","created_at":"2020-08-07T10:16:23.009000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741238303134711808","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Web nods. \"Web believes Ebuc regretted his choices. Why he went with the others on that mission. To have chance at redemption.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T10:17:41.449000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-07T10:18:41.041000Z","id":"741238632136048680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf nods slowly, a few more pieces finally fitting into place. \"Okay... Well, hopefully we're able to figure out exactly what it is they want. It's tricky fighting against something that just wants 'power'. That could be a lot of things...\" She sighs \"but I don't think we'll figure all that out tonight. I'm just glad you're on the right path. I'm sorry I doubted you.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T10:30:55.239000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-07T10:31:24.317000Z","id":"741241961532358696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
